  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names the move while fighting Qi Sea Ancestor above Eastern Sea, after heartache crying blood. Countless formless qi currents slash the sky. The qi currents weave into a net that covers the Gu Immortals and Immortal Gu Houses, engraving lightning and qi path dao marks on their bodies. As long as targets are trapped inside, they constantly receive injuries. Both sides start retreating.",
